# Public site repo for Archiwum Wielkiej Apostazji — this is THE repo that
# gets published on GitHub Pages, so everything in it is meant to be public
# by definition. Kept as an explicit allowlist for consistency with the
# sibling awa-desk / archiwum(-admin) repos, not because anything here is
# sensitive.
*

!.gitignore
!*.md
!index.html
!*.bat
!assets/
!assets/**
!data/
!data/**
!CNAME
!tests/
!tests/**
tests/_*
